+/// `regexLiteralToken`: a Swift regex literal, scanned as the compiler scans it. Three layers, each a
+/// port of compiler code (`swiftlang/swift` and `swift-experimental-string-processing`):
+///
+/// 1. MODE, for a bare `/`: `Parser::tryLexRegexLiteral` (`ParseExpr.cpp`). The operator token that
